i--- Building from Source ---------------------------------------------	header null 0

The main target of this application is Windows, although some efforts
have been made to port it to UNIX variants, but have since stalled.

For the Windows port the application, it's designed to be compatible
with Windows 95 all the way to the latest AI garbage from Microsoft,
which is currently Windows 11. It comes with a project for Visual
Studio 6 (requires the Windows Server 2003 PSDK) and a solution for
Visual Studio 2010.

